<section id="A1.SS4.SSS3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.4.3 </span>Fine-tuning Implementations</h4>

<div id="A1.SS4.SSS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS4.SSS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We utilize four H100 80GB GPUs for full-parameter fine-tuning of the Qwen2-VL-7B model. The model is trained for 3 epochs in the SFT stage. The learning rate is set to <math id="A1.SS4.SSS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\times 10^{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\times 10^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math>. We use a batch size of 2 for training. We use 10% of the training data for validation, and we select the model with the lowest validation loss. We perform the inference of SimVLM using a single H100 80GB GPU.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS4.SSS4" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.4.4 </span>Input and Output Examples</h4>

