<div id="A1.SS5.SSS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.SSS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">After generating the problem file, GenVLM continues to generate the domain file based on the example of the grid, domain, and problem descriptions, image observation, and the generated problem file. The prompt for this is:</p>
